{"meta":{"domain":"Domain 1: Future-Ready Workforce","job_family":"E-commerce operations","country":"Malaysia","target_population":"Final-year students and early-career workers, 0-3 years","data_version":"v3","status":"final","production_ready":true,"intended_use":"Production dataset for the Domain 1 Future-Ready Workforce prototype.","last_updated":"2026-10-23","methodology":"v3 retains Period A and uses 19 dated JobStreet Malaysia postings for Period B. Direct HTTP requests to JobStreet returned 403, so every selected actual job page was rendered in Chrome and manually reviewed on 2026-10-23. Period B uses 2026-08-02 to 2026-09-26. The data-role sample now has five exact and two adjacent titles, matching Period A.","limitations":["Posting-derived signal records in trend_signals remain cross-sectional v2 prevalence records and do not establish time trends.","The Period B JobStreet samples are small and purposive: 7 current-role, 7 data-role and 5 AI-content postings.","All three Period B comparison compositions now match Period A: current role 6 exact + 1 senior, data role 5 exact + 2 adjacent, and AI content 5 adjacent.","The data-role comparisons are rebuilt with 7 Period B postings, but every trend remains initial-scale and provisional.","WEF evidence is global and forecast-based; DOSM evidence is national labour-market context rather than occupational skill demand.","One v2 job posting remains undated and is excluded from comparisons; 15 course sources also lack a reliable original publication date.","Six-week pathways provide a foundation and portfolio, not professional proficiency.","Transition fit and scenario scores are documented assumptions, not forecasts or individual assessments.","Direct HTTP requests to JobStreet returned HTTP 403; selected pages were manually reviewed in rendered browser sessions and recorded as manual_browser_review."],"known_issues":[],"executive_summary_en":"v3 uses 19 manually reviewed JobStreet Malaysia postings for Period B. The data-role sample now contains 7 postings with 5 exact + 2 adjacent titles, matching Period A, and all 12 data-role comparisons were rebuilt. Initial data-role changes include lower SQL, Excel, data-analysis, visualization and dashboard prevalence, higher statistics prevalence, and changing Python and ETL signals. The current-role and AI-content compositions also match Period A. All findings remain initial-scale and provisional, while duplicate-role, reference and source-family checks pass.","previous_version":"v2","periods":[{"period_id":"period_a","label":"2026-09-27 to 2026-10-22","role":"baseline","source_family":"JobStreet Malaysia","posting_count":22},{"period_id":"period_b","label":"2026-08-02 to 2026-09-26","role":"comparison","source_family":"JobStreet Malaysia","posting_count":19}],"period_notes":["Period A retains the dated v2 JobStreet baseline from 2026-09-27 to 2026-10-22.","The preferred 2026-08-01 to 2026-09-20 window lacked enough JobStreet postings, so Period B uses the closest earlier eight-week window, 2026-08-02 to 2026-09-26, entirely before Period A.","The v2 undated AI posting src_021 is retained with period_id \"unassigned\" and excluded from comparisons."],"source_change_reason_en":null,"comparison_quality":"same_source_two_period","production_ready_scope":"profiles_and_partial_trends"},"source_registry":[{"source_id":"src_001","source_type":"job_posting","source_name":"E-Commerce Operation Executive (Store) - Beauty Industry","publisher":"Jobstreet Malaysia","source_url":"https://my.jobstreet.com/job/95341826","published_date":"2026-10-20","checked_date":"2026-10-23","country":"Malaysia","industry":"E-commerce / beauty retail","role_id":"ecommerce_operations_executive","notes":"Listed three days ago when checked. Explicitly covers product listings, Shopee/Lazada/TikTok, orders, stock, reports, customer service, campaigns and process improvement.","needs_verification":false,"access_status":"verified","verified_http_status":null,"updated_da