://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/paths/get-started-with-microsoft-power-bi-for-business-users/","checked_date":"2026-10-23","reason":"Excluded after the URL returned a 404 page."},{"source_name":"Semrush SEO Fundamentals","source_url":"https://www.semrush.com/academy/courses/seo-fundamentals/","checked_date":"2026-10-23","reason":"Excluded after the URL returned a 404 page."}],"data_gaps":[{"gap_id":"gap_001","scope":"Malaysia / e-commerce operations","description_en":"No representative longitudinal Malaysian vacancy series was available for the current, data, or AI-content role clusters.","needed_verification_en":"Collect at least two comparable time periods for the same role definitions before making directional local skill claims."},{"gap_id":"gap_002","scope":"Malaysia / skills","description_en":"DOSM provides national labour-market context but does not identify demand for either target occupation or their specific skills.","needed_verification_en":"Use an occupation-level Malaysian survey or employer panel with skill fields."},{"gap_id":"gap_003","scope":"Global / WEF","description_en":"WEF skill-growth findings are global employer-survey forecasts and are not Malaysia-specific vacancy counts.","needed_verification_en":"Separate global forecast evidence from local observed demand in any frontend interpretation."},{"gap_id":"gap_004","scope":"Malaysia / target roles","description_en":"Several reviewed AI-content postings use adjacent, senior, or specialist titles rather than exact AI Content Operations Specialist titles.","needed_verification_en":"Collect exact-title postings across multiple months before estimating role-specific vacancy demand."},{"gap_id":"gap_005","scope":"Learning resources","description_en":"No single verified course is registered for both content analytics and marketing analytics.","needed_verification_en":"Keep the project-based pathway step or add separately verified analytics resources."},{"gap_id":"gap_007","scope":"Malaysia / AI-content exact titles","description_en":"No exact AI Content Operations Specialist title was found in the selected JobStreet windows; the comparison uses five adjacent titles in each period.","needed_verification_en":"Recover or collect exact-title AI content operations postings across both periods."},{"gap_id":"gap_008","scope":"Malaysia / Period A undated source","description_en":"The v2 AI-content posting src_021 has no reliable calendar date and is assigned to unassigned rather than either period.","needed_verification_en":"Recover the original publication date before using src_021 in a two-period comparison."},{"gap_id":"gap_009","scope":"Malaysia / JobStreet sample size","description_en":"The final JobStreet comparison samples contain 7 current-role, 7 data-role and 5 AI-content postings.","needed_verification_en":"Expand to at least 15 composition-matched postings per role before making stronger claims."},{"gap_id":"gap_010","scope":"Malaysia / AI-content skills","description_en":"The five JobStreet AI-content postings contained no explicit workflow-automation, content-analytics, SEO or marketing-analytics mentions under the adopted counting rules.","needed_verification_en":"Review a larger adjacent-title AI-content sample before changing the v2 skill profile."},{"gap_id":"gap_011","scope":"Malaysia / JobStreet access","description_en":"Direct HTTP requests to JobStreet returned HTTP 403 even though rendered pages were manually reviewed.","needed_verification_en":"Preserve manual-review notes and rendered-page evidence for any future refresh."}],"change_log":[{"change_id":"chg_001","category":"trend_reclassification","record_ids":["sig_001","sig_002","sig_003","sig_004","sig_005","sig_006","sig_007","sig_008","sig_009","sig_010","sig_011","sig_012","sig_013","sig_014","sig_015","sig_016","sig_017","sig_018","sig_019","sig_020","sig_021","sig_022","sig_023","sig_024","sig_025","sig_026","sig_027","sig_028","sig_029","sig_030","sig_031","sig_032","sig_033","sig_034"],"summary_en":"All 34 posting-derived signals are now treated as cross-sectional prevalence and have trend status 'insufficient'.","reason_en":"A single purposive sample cannot establish a time direction. The current counts remain visible through current_prevalence and trend_note_en."},{"change_id":"chg_002","category":"new_evidence","record_ids":["sig_035","sig_036","sig_037","sig_038","sig_039"],"summary_en":"Added five report-backed or official-statistics-backed macro records using WEF, the Malaysia Digital Economy Blueprint, and DOSM.","reason_en":"The input registered these sources but did not use them as trend records. The new signals keep global, national, and role-specific scopes separate."},{"change_id":"chg_003","category":"role_skill_reclassification","record_ids":["data_operations_analyst"],"summary_en":"Moved basic Python to recommended, and business analysis and data pipelines/ETL to insufficient, removing duplicate assignments.","reason_en":"Python had one explicit posting mention, while business analysis and ETL had none. Only target skills with at least three mentions remain core."},{"change_id":"chg_004","category":"role_skill_reclassification","record_ids":["ai_content_operations_specialist"],"summary_en":"Moved content operations, prompt engineering, and marketing analytics to recommended and removed core/emerging duplicates.","reason_en":"The three skills had one, two, and one explicit posting mentions respectively. AI evaluation, brand safety, and workflow automation now each have one status."},{"change_id":"chg_005","category":"score_change","record_ids":["ecommerce_to_data_operations","ecommerce_to_ai_content_operations"],"summary_en":"Recalculated transition fit from 57 to 63 for data operations and from 50 to 49 for AI content operations.","reason_en":"The revised scores use the v1 weighting method but exclude recommended and unsupported target skills from core coverage; every input and inference is recorded in score_method."},{"change_id":"chg_006","category":"source_quality","record_ids":["src_021","src_033","src_040"],"summary_en":"Replaced the relative job date with unknown, verified the SEO guide and HubSpot course, and removed HubSpot from the excluded-source list.","reason_en":"The SEO guide loaded with a 2025-12-18 update date, and the HubSpot course loaded as a free 8h23m resource. The relative job date was not converted into an unsupported calendar date."},{"change_id":"chg_007","category":"learning_resource_repair","record_ids":["res_007","res_008"],"summary_en":"Aligned SEO resource verification and date fields, added a duration plan, and replaced the unverified HubSpot free alternative with the verified registered course.","reason_en":"The resource and source records now agree, and the copywriting paid resource has a live free alternative."},{"change_id":"chg_008","category":"sdg_remapping","record_ids":["sdg_001","sdg_002","sdg_003","sdg_004","sdg_005","sdg_006","sdg_007","sdg_008","sdg_009","sdg_010","sdg_011","sdg_012"],"summary_en":"Replaced track-level-only SDG entries with role and skill mappings, including SQL, data visualization, AI evaluation, and brand safety.","reason_en":"Each mapping now has an explicit target, a specific rationale, and source references."},{"change_id":"chg_009","category":"validation","record_ids":["quality_checks","validation_report"],"summary_en":"Recalculated source, trend, posting, signal, reference, and missing-date counts from the v2 arrays.","reason_en":"The v1 hand-written counts conflicted with the records and the quality metadata."},{"change_id":"chg_010","category":"source_quality","record_ids":["src_026","src_029","src_033","src_036","src_039","src_041"],"summary_en":"Replaced the Blueprint mirror with the verified mydigital.gov.my PDF, aligned course names, and recorded publication and update dates separately.","reason_en":"The official URL returned HTTP 200 with application/pdf on 2026-10-23, and the replacement SQL and Python resources avoid the Kaggle browser challenge."},{"change_id":"chg_011","category":"production_readiness","record_ids":["res_001","res_003","res_007","res_008"],"summary_en":"Completed free-alternative audit dates, replaced challenged Kaggle pages, and made v2 production metadata reproducible.","reason_en":"Every learning resource and paid alternative now carries publication, check, access, and verification fields, while the build emits identical canonical and mirror files."},{"change_id":"chg_012","category":"period_b_source_replacement","record_ids":["src_059","src_060","src_061","src_062","src_063","src_064","src_065","src_066","src_067","src_068","src_069","src_070","src_071","src_072","src_073","src_074","src_075"],"summary_en":"Replaced all 17 LinkedIn Period B sources with 17 manually reviewed JobStreet Malaysia job pages.","reason_en":"The revised dataset requires the same source family in both periods; replaced records are preserved in excluded_sources."},{"change_id":"chg_013","category":"posting_counts","record_ids":["src_059","src_060","src_061","src_062","src_063","src_064","src_065","src_066","src_067","src_068","src_069","src_070","src_071","src_072","src_073","src_074","src_075","src_076","src_077"],"summary_en":"Added 7 current-role, 7 data-role and 5 AI-content JobStreet postings dated 2026-08-02 through 2026-09-26.","reason_en":"The preferred window had too few dated JobStreet postings, so the closest earlier eight-week window was used; two exact data titles were added in the final pass."},{"change_id":"chg_014","category":"new_skills","record_ids":[],"summary_en":"No new skill IDs were added; every counted skill maps to the existing taxonomy.","reason_en":"The JobStreet descriptions used existing skill terms or did not provide explicit evidence for additional skills."},{"change_id":"chg_015","category":"trend_direction","record_ids":["cmp_001","cmp_002","cmp_003","cmp_004","cmp_005","cmp_006","cmp_007","cmp_008","cmp_009","cmp_010","cmp_011","cmp_012","cmp_0