sed dataset received a complete structural and evidence-rule check."},{"change_id":"chg_020","category":"data_role_evidence_expansion","record_ids":["src_076","src_077","cmp_012","cmp_013","cmp_014","cmp_015","cmp_016","cmp_017","cmp_018","cmp_019","cmp_020","cmp_021","cmp_022","cmp_023"],"summary_en":"Added 2 exact JobStreet Data Operations Analyst postings in Period B, matched the 5 exact + 2 adjacent composition, and rebuilt all 12 data-role comparisons.","reason_en":"The two additional pages were manually reviewed and their explicit skill mentions were added to the existing taxonomy."}],"README_UPDATE_EN":"Backend must use v3.json only when meta.production_ready is true. v2.json is the previous-period baseline. v1.json is historical only. Do not use LinkedIn Period B sources in production comparisons."}